    "section_accordions_6dTVbD": {
      "type": "section-accordions",
      "blocks": {
        "text_k3q8UK": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Why choose the Koozi Crate?",
            "text": "<p>Forget everything you thought you knew about dog crates. Traditional ones are bulky, unattractive, and take up too much space. The Koozi Crate changes all that. It’s a secure, cosy sanctuary for your dog and a sleek, functional side table for your home. A true 2-in-1 solution, it’s space-saving, stylish, and built to last.<br/><br/>Whether you use it as a dog den or for crate training, it will adapt to you and your dog's needs.</p><p>If you’ve ever ruled out a crate because of how it looks - or worried your dog wouldn’t take to it- the Koozi Crate will change your mind.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_Qp9PrH": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Who is the Koozi Crate for?",
            "text": "<p>The Koozi Crate is for dog parents looking to replace mismatched crates or worn-out beds with a lasting solution that provides style, comfort and security. Designed as both a cosy, safe retreat for your dog and a stylish side table for your home, the Koozi Crate offers two essentials in one – a timeless investment you won’t want to hide away.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_RMwfpX": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Does it matter if we don't crate train?",
            "text": "<p>Yes! Absolutely. Even if you don’t crate train, the Koozi Crate is designed to serve as a cosy den with the door up, offering a safe and secure space for your dog - particularly dogs with anxiety. Vets recommend crates because dogs naturally seek secure places to relax. </p><p>So whether you crate train or not, the Koozi Crate provides your dog with a peaceful retreat, while functioning as a side table for your home.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_yAUdPd": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Why is it more expensive than wire crates?",
            "text": "<p>The Koozi Crate is more than just a dog crate - it’s a high-quality, multifunctional furniture piece that combines a stylish side table with a comfortable retreat for your dog.</p><p>This clever design maximises space, saving both cost and clutter compared to purchasing a wire dog crate and a separate side table. The price reflects the premium materials and expert craftsmanship used to create its unique design, ensuring long-term durability and value.<br/><br/>It's an investment in your dog's comfort, and in your home sanctuary.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_BQM7PX": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Where do I put it in my home?",
            "text": "<p>Think of it this way: where would you put a side table? Since the Koozi Crate is more than just a dog crate, there’s no need to hide it away. Place it next to your sofa for easy access, in a shaded corner of your home, by your bedside for a peaceful nighttime retreat, or in your office to keep your dog close, all the while giving them their own safe comfy space.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
